    {
      "id": "en.n9.class-16.t02",
      "en": "Hello Mrs Kent, could you look at the heating this week? I would be grateful.",
      "es": "Hola, señora Kent, ¿podría revisar la calefacción esta semana? Se lo agradecería.",
